## ── ELITE v1.0.4 · Desktop v2 (macOS-style, mouse-first) ──────────────
## nwg-drawer: o "Launchpad" — grade de apps em tela cheia com busca,
## categorias e barra de sessão (craft-drawer). wlroots-agnóstico.
## papirus-icon-theme: ícones de apps p/ o dock (waybar wlr/taskbar),
## Launchpad e GTK (settings.ini do skel aponta Papirus-Dark).
## catppuccin-gtk-theme-mocha: tema GTK oficial Catppuccin (repo [archcraft])
## — variantes Standard-<accent>-Dark; o skel usa a Mauve (= acento do rice:
## fuzzel/swaync/dock/borda de janela). gtk-engine-murrine: engine exigida.
## archcraft-cursor-bibata: cursor Bibata — o cursor dos melhores rices.
nwg-drawer
papirus-icon-theme
catppuccin-gtk-theme-mocha
gtk-engine-murrine
archcraft-cursor-bibata

